{"3312340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "风之歌", "steam_appid": 3312340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312340/extras/1b0087c249d290b6f4c1ecb672245215.avif?t=1745397957\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312340/extras_big/1b0087c249d290b6f4c1ecb672245215.avif?t=1745397957 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original manuscript of this work was completed in early 2015. Please refer to the common sense, standards, rules, etc. in the text at that time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This software is a visual novel with no options at all. The text has been polished and carefully arranged, with 2D illustrations and real-life photos complementing each other, giving new life in a music that matches the atmosphere and is just right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a text of 110000 words, it describes the different thoughts and romantic love of multiple characters, and constructs a wonderful experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without much thought about life, Luo Yu accidentally enrolled in Qingling University. By chance, she joined a strange club and met many characters with different personalities. The story begins from then on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players (audience) will take on the role of Luo Yu, experiencing a romantic relationship with the female protagonist day and night, witnessing the joys and sorrows of each character, and moving towards a unique ending driven by fate.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse